{"thread":{"threadID":3494,"boardID":207,"topic":"Surf DM RPG Spawnkiller","time":1460305617,"userID":1752,"username":"Bretzel","lastPostTime":1463060032,"lastPoster":"Bretzel","replies":8,"views":1143,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":1},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":46111,"threadID":3494,"userID":1752,"username":"Bretzel","subject":"Surf DM RPG Spawnkiller","time":1460305617,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1460395494,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hi,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I ask a sanction against the team &quot;therealfdp&quot;. While on the map colos they spawnkilled a lot but before I could record a demo the map changed. On utopia (the nextmap) they didn&#x27;t spawnkilled but one of then did something that made me suspect him of wallhack (at least). The next map was Cram.<br>I know that map, it&#x27;s realy hard to not spawnkill.<br>Anyway, at the 9th minute, the player started to spawnkill then shortly after at 9&#x27;50 a friend of him joined and start spawnkill too. (He was also saying insult to another player on the vocal chat )<br>Their behaviour is not surprising in fact, their team name mean &quot;the real son of bitch&quot;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://uptobox.com/n4ynfrsh3npn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">therealfpd spawnkill on Cram.dem - 59.9 MB</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/id/hyperenkzor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/id/Twinskillers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":46112,"threadID":3494,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1460308099,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>He is right. I got anoth